{#- ── Demo-entity election ────────────────────────────────────────────────
     A verbatim copy of the election in teksilo_app.tera. It has to be a copy:
     Tera renders an `include` in a child stack frame, so a `set_global` made
     inside one is popped before the caller can read it, and a `macro` can only
     return rendered text. So the copy is *checked* rather than hoped for --
     `app.rs` publishes its own result as `app::DEMO_ENTITY`, and the first test
     below compares the two. Edit one election without the other and the suite
     says so, instead of quietly exercising a list the window never shows. -#}
